B.bjo=new A.fa("1. Data Controller","Madio Express, operating in Colombia, is the controller of the personal data collected through the platform. This policy is issued under Colombia's Law 1581 of 2012 and Decree 1377 of 2013, and in compliance with Google Play requirements.")
B.bja=new A.fa("2. Information We Collect","Identification and contact data (name, email, phone); account and authentication data (if you sign in with Google, your name, email and profile picture); business data (store name, logo, address, catalog); product and logo images taken from the camera or gallery; order and payment data; and usage, device and approximate location data (city/shipping address). As an administration tool, you also register data about your own customers (name, phone, address), for which we act as processor.")
B.bj_=new A.fa("3. Purposes of Processing","Create and manage your account; provide and improve the service; process orders, inventory, payments and billing; generate shipping quotes and labels; operate the AI assistant; send operational notifications; perform analytics; and handle support and legal obligations.")
B.bj4=new A.fa("4. Sharing With Third Parties","We do not sell your data. We share it only with providers necessary to operate the service: Google/Firebase (authentication, analytics and cloud), Aveonline (shipping quotes and labels), Anthropic/Claude (AI assistant), payment gateways (payment processing) and WhatsApp (notifications). Also when required by law.")
B.bj9=new A.fa("5. Information Security","We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures: encryption in transit (HTTPS/TLS), secure authentication with Firebase Auth and session tokens (JWT), encrypted storage of credentials on the device, backend access protected by an API Gateway, and hosting on Google Cloud.")
B.bjk=new A.fa("6. Retention and Account Deletion",'We retain your data while your account is active and for as long as needed to fulfill purposes and legal obligations. You can delete your account directly from the app (menu - "Eliminar mi cuenta") or via the contact channels; doing so erases and anonymizes your personal data, except order and payment records that are kept de-identified for legal obligations.')
B.bj6=new A.fa("7. Your Rights (Law 1581 of 2012)","You may know, update and rectify your data; request proof of authorization; be informed of its use; revoke authorization and request deletion; access your data free of charge; and file complaints with the Colombian Superintendence of Industry and Commerce (SIC). We answer inquiries within 10 business days and claims within 15 business days.")
B.biZ=new A.fa("8. Children","The platform is intended for merchants, not children. We do not intentionally collect children's data; if we detect data collected without authorization, we will delete it.")
B.bjb=new A.fa("9. Contact","To exercise your rights or resolve questions, write to info@madio-express.com or via WhatsApp at +57 311 311 4315. See the full version online using the button below.")
